  <History Date="14-05-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Ayrton Eurus-S (effectively identical.  gobo images are missing slot numbers.  assumed gobo 1 is the same.  gobo 2 images look different even though the names are the same as the Ayrton.  this looks wrong.  images omitted for now)" Version="5" />
